# The governed schema-v4 Parquet fixtures and their completion markers are
# intentionally versioned. Runtime leaves remain visible so they cannot be
# mistaken for, or silently bundled with, the checked-in fixture archive.
data/histo/.*.pending-*/
# DuckDB is opened in memory over Parquet. Never persist local scratch databases.
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
